+//   name, +0x250 job building name, +0x258 job title, +0x260 job city, +0x268 personal name)
+//   +0x270/+0x274 EQ / HQ  +0x278/+0x280 (released only)  +0x288 ghost effect  +0x290 random (seed 0xffffffff)
+//   +0x2a8/+0x2c0 six-month EQ / HQ histories, +0x2d8/+0x2d9 ring indices, +0x2dc/+0x2e0 monthly deltas
